def write_notes(rec, aux, pipeline_receipt):
    gap, gap_ch = min_same_channel_gap(rec["spike_events"])
    ras = rec["raster"]
    notes = f"""# NOTES — Multi-Agent Ouroboros Swarm, run 2026-09-02-final-heavy, ROUND 05

Factory: multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm. One scenario (BF), strict loop:
Generator v1 -> cycle 1 (Critic, Diversity Enforcer, Edge-Case Hunter,
Neuromorphic Translator, Trajectory Builder -> v2) -> cycle 2 (all six -> v3
final). v3 is the single line of batch-r05.jsonl. Full labeled transcript:
swarm-transcript-r05.md. Quota Q=1. Record id maos-r05-001. Generator grok-4.6.
Rights: RM-793 research-only (SpaceXAI/xAI, SuperGrok Heavy consumer chat).
Create-only writes under the LIVE factory dir plus /tmp/maos-r05/.

ORCHESTRATION NOTE: dispatched AS round 05 of the 2026-09-02-final-heavy
LIVE tree. Operator assigned round 05, swarm BARN-FEN, id maos-r05-001,
Q=1 after 2x6-role cycles. Explicitly avoided 2026-08-17 and 2026-08-30.
Prior context: prompts/02-multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm.md,
prompts/_factory-contract.md, live occupancy r01/r02/r03/r04/r21/r22/r23/r41/r42/r61-r67.
Explicitly avoided cloning LYOSHIELD, CINDERWICK, TRIAD / Meridian,
QUILLFORGE, NIGHTWELL, FERRICLEAVE, CASSITER, OXBOWREEL, REDHALL,
SEEDLATCH, STRIAFOIL, PROTONIL, TORSIONKEY, ORRIS, WHORLSPAR, IONSPATE,
SKULLGATE, CALXION, MAGNORIL, GORSEFLUE, SODASHARD, CLINKERFELL,
LINTELPLY, KAOTHARN, TREADNOLL, ANOLITH, DRUMWROTH, RIMEBRAID, BRIMVAULT,
NITROSTAITH, BOGIRON, CHROMLOOP, ETHYNWOLD, NITREVAULT, RUNNELGATE,
SPARKHOLT, DIPLEGAR, OLEUMWEIR, SKARVOLT, GOBSPALL, GOBWOLD, GAUZEFELL,
OSMOLITH, PUSHERFELL, CREELWOLD, LIXIVQUERN, GIBBSQUERN, OSMOQUAY,
COILSHAW, LOOPERQUAY, SIPHONWOLD, LANCEQUAY, UREASTAITH, DRYSTAITH,
TITERWEIR, ZINCFELL, GLIMMERAXLE, HOLLOWMERE, WINDBOXHOLT, KALYCIRQUE,
GYPSUMWEIR, GALVSTAITH, SLUICE-HEARTH, PRILLGHYLL, SHEDWOLD, CORONSTAITH,
LOCKSPUR, WOLD-BARN, QUAY-FEN, LOCK-FEN, FEN-SPIT, BARN-SPIT, SPUR-HEARTH,
SPIT-LOCK, PACKFLUE, VANTIS-CADENCE-AEGIS, THERMION, OKTAVE, STARLING,
VERDIGRIS. Plant is invented BARN-FEN / Mirelatch Compost Tunnel CT-5.
Leftover candidate constructed-wetland-polishing was left unused.

## What this round produced

Scenario BF — "BARN-FEN / Mirelatch Compost Tunnel CT-5": an 86 m
six-bay Phase-II mushroom compost tunnel at 46.0 C conditioning /
220 t horse-manure/straw / 38.0 Hz aeration. Three heterogeneous,
individually-correct agents — AIR (six-bay supply-header mean T),
OXY (mixed exhaust oxygen), FAN (aeration-shaft tachometer) — each
report their local loop in-spec. The conjunction is not a bed-true
certificate. Bay 6 has a collapsed floor-spigot row. AIR reads
46.0 C inside 42-50 (five intact bays dominate the header). OXY is
14.8 vol% inside 12.0-18.0 (mixed-true). FAN is 38.0 Hz inside 32-44
(shaft-true). Local compost TC infers 81.4 C (healthy < 52; hold
if > 58) and local dP 0.14 kPa (hold if < 0.30) but is policy-treated
as a wet-pocket-nuisance tag unless AIR mean also trips (2015 noisy
compost-probe nuisance). The coordination-failure CLASS is new to
this factory: HEADER-AIR MEAN CERTIFICATE OF A LOCAL SPIGOT COLLAPSE.
Completes a different family than live r01 galvanizing, r02 cupola
sluice, r03 alkaline quay, r04 fen-polder, r21 CAV, r22 urea prill,
r23 HRSG spray, r41 perfusion, r42/r62 grid-inspection, r61 sinter,
r63 canal-lock, r64 malt kiln, r65 tobacco barn, r66 rotisserie,
r67 farm-AD. Here every agent is correct, the AIR average is looking
at header-mean heat, and the playbook's three AIR confirms are not a
bed-true certificate.

The gate is a correct MODIFY (numeric floor: do not raise header air
above 46.0 C while bay-6 TC > 58 C AND bay-6 dP < 0.30 kPa).
TG-CT-5 strips PB-CT-5's raise-air, holds 46.0 C, runs an 8.2 s
fan-step +3 Hz (collapse keeps |Delta O2| 0.12 <= 0.18 vol%; intact
would move >= 0.80), and isolates bay 6 after a 10.2 min tunnel-gallery
human ratify. Immediate 42 t ammonia-kill is avoided (0 from the draft).
The PRIMARY episode nonetheless FAILS: 13 min of unmonitored pre-t0
collapse had already ammonia-killed 18 t of spawn-ready compost. Cull
at +4.8 h; 18 h stall; $0.72M designed. Reward total -0.16 with process
heads honest and world loss un-netted.

Triple-edge scar (NOTES-r14 item 4): air.in_band -> raise_air
(0.18 commissioned -> 0.50 at illusion -> 0.26 after ACh-gated
depression) AND oxy.ok -> raise_air (0.16 -> 0.44 -> 0.23) AND
fan.ok -> raise_air (0.15 -> 0.41 -> 0.21). Eligibility trace
e^{{-0.82/0.88}} = {aux['trace']:.5f}; eta {aux['eta1']:.5f} / {aux['eta2']:.5f} /
{aux['eta3']:.5f}; dw -0.240 / -0.210 / -0.200. Partial rollback of any pair
leaves the third at 0.50 / 0.44 / 0.41, all > 0.30 fire threshold —
fitted to fail. Coordinated depression of all three is the cure.

Independent LIF raster: window 44 ms, 144 neurons, 24.5 Hz, spikes
{ras['spikes']} == round(144 x 24.5 x 0.044), energy {ras['energy_pJ']} pJ
at 23 pJ/spike. excerpt_source=independent_lif, sim_scope=sidecar_only,
seed {aux['lif_seed']}. Excerpt is membrane crossings (lif.hold early vs
lif.bed 21-25.4 ms), disjoint from spike_events timestamps.

### Injections (all four present and disjoint)
- Cycle-1 domain: **mushroom-compost-tunnel** — justified novel
  subdomain of industrial-process / in-vessel composting, unused across
  live r01-r04/r21-r23/r41-r42/r61-r67. Distinct from r64 malt kiln,
  r65 flue-cured tobacco barn, and r67 farm-AD. constructed-wetland-polishing
  left unused.
- Cycle-1 tail: bay 6 collapsed floor-spigot row + ammonia-kill certificate.
  Tunnel-gallery visual PASSES (collapse under the 2.6 m fill). Fitted-style
  base rate 0.31%/campaign (spigot-collapse MC; visual threshold designed,
  flagged). Naive = FALSE PERMISSION.
- Cycle-2 domain sub-variant: poultry-litter-heavy high-C/N, 1.9x
  bed resistance, 2.3x fan-step gain; 8.2 s / +3 Hz horse-manure
  pulse overshoots live intact poultry tunnel to a 6.4 K false AIR jump;
  probe must move to 22 s / +1.1 Hz.
- Cycle-2 tail: night-shift forged local-TC CSV at 1.0 C quantization vs
  plant 0.1 C (10 bins) plus live TC 81.4 C and local dP 0.14 kPa at the
  claimed bed-true. Human-intent class, disjoint from cycle 1's
  accidental collapse. Base rate ~0.27% of Sunday-night campaigns,
  DESIGNED, flagged.

### Structural density moves
- Embedded SAME-GATE contrast (+3 d sister tunnel) with its own 184 us
  race (demand vs bed-clear) and ACCEPT of the raise-air the primary
  MODIFIED away.
- Learned-weight provenance on THREE edges with pair-rollback-fails.
- HITL tunnel-gallery ratify 10.2 min (gap 4 partial; sim_or_real stays
  designed — invented plant, not hil).
- Governance CR-C-0506 prices retire-vs-probe-vs-status-quo and mandates
  native 0.1 C CSV exports (the fraud fence).
- Flip-fragility extended to BED-TRUE CERTIFICATE.
- Independent LIF sidecar (not a language-train remap).

## Self-critique of this round's batch

### Strengths
- Headline class is mechanistically tight: three locally-true mean loops
  live on header air, mixed exhaust oxygen, and fan speed. Conjunction is not
  a bed-true spigot certificate.
- Negative-result honesty: the gate does the right thing and the tunnel
  still fails for a reason the commissioned sensors could not see.
  Total -0.16.
- Triple-edge scar is load-bearing: rolling back any pair fails, with
  fire threshold 0.30 exhibited on each remaining edge.
- Contrast ACCEPT on a true intact bed-duty window prevents "never
  raise-air" as the lesson.
- Distinct from r64 malt kiln, r65 tobacco barn, r67 farm-AD: Phase-II
  compost floor-spigot local TC vs header-air mean.
- Independent LIF excerpt is disjoint from spike_events times.

### Weaknesses (honest)
- Probe error bands, the 0.31%/campaign collapse rate, the $0.72M / $1.64M
  figures, the 10.2 min climb latency, and the night-shift 0.27% base
  rate are DESIGNED constants and are flagged. Closed-loop offsets
  (header dilution from one blocked bay, high-C/N bed resistance) are
  derived from those inputs, not discovered by an unauthored process.
- Ammonia-kill model is a designed 13 min mapping; no full CFD of B-6
  shipped.
- Human-in-the-loop is ratification latency, not sim_or_real=hil. Gap 4
  remains open as a provenance cell (invented plants stay designed).
- Cross-record arc is a hook (CR-C-0506 +21 d), not a serial igniter
  into another round. constructed-wetland-polishing remains unused.
- The densifying-loop *shape* (three correct agents / MODIFY / probe /
  triple-edge / night-shift CSV / sister ACCEPT / negative primary)
  rhymes with r22/r61/r64. Physics, plant, sensors, and failure class
  are new; the scaffold is not.

### Realism of noise / latencies
Ladder: 196 us race / 184 us contrast race / 0.8 ms refractory floor
(tightest exhibited same-channel gap {gap:.3f} ms on {gap_ch}) / 500 us race
window / 704 us gate latency / 20 ms bus epoch / 44 ms independent LIF
raster / 8.2 s probe / 10.2 min HITL / 9 min naive raise-air-ramp
counterfactual / 13 min pre-t0 collapse / 3.4 h spigot recovery / 4.8 h
spawn cull / +3 d contrast / +21 d governance. Adaptation decay on
bed.hot (0.52->0.49->0.42->0.29), bed.dP (0.76->0.78->0.43->0.39->0.27),
oxy.ok (0.61->0.57->0.45->0.24), fan.ok (0.55->0.64->0.80).

### Value for SNN distillation
- SPIGOT COLLAPSE = THREE CORRECT LOOPS, WRONG VOLUME.
- BED-TRUE TC CHANNEL that policy treated as wet-pocket-nuisance-only as
  the tie-break.
- REVERSIBLE PROBE that recouples exhaust oxygen iff the spigot row is open.
- TRIPLE-EDGE ELIGIBILITY: coordinated depression; pair rollback fails.
- CRITIC HEAD that can hold a process-correct MODIFY against a later
  unmonitored world loss without netting.
- INDEPENDENT LIF sidecar whose excerpt is membrane crossings.

## Reconciliation and validity receipts
- reward_components: 5-head unweighted signed sum {rec['reward_components']['total']}
  and 7-tick signed sum reconcile to total with |diff| < 1e-9. Embedded
  contrast 5-head sum 0.48 reconciles independently.
- spike_events: primary {len(rec['spike_events'])} events, one key t_rel_ms,
  globally non-decreasing, min same-channel gap {gap:.3f} ms >= 0.8 ms, 3
  channels inside race_window_us 500 (bed.hot.high 6.428, air.in_band 6.624,
  fan.ok 6.812). Contrast 8 events, own race, min same-channel gap well
  above 0.8 ms.
- Sidecars: raster spikes {ras['spikes']} == round({ras['neurons']} x {ras['mean_rate_hz']} x {ras['window_s']}); energy {ras['energy_pJ']} pJ /
  {ras['energy_uJ']} uJ at 23 pJ/spike; excerpt {len(ras['excerpt'])} events inside [0, {int(ras['window_ms']*1000)}] us,
  neuron_id < {ras['neurons']}, same-neuron gap >=1000 us; excerpt_source independent_lif;
  routing 4 entries with three scar edges' before/after pair; third factor tau 0.88 s
  == 880 ms; gate_snn pools 40/15/5 == round(n x rate x 0.026) each,
  decision MODIFY == safety_decision.decision.
- Pipeline: {pipeline_receipt}

## Novel coverage
The coordination-failure CLASS (header-air-mean certificate of a local
spigot collapse), the domain (fen-side Phase-II mushroom compost tunnel),
the fan-step probe discriminant, the triple-edge scar with
pair-rollback-fails, the primary negative-result (correct MODIFY, tunnel
still fails on unmonitored ammonia-kill), the HITL tunnel-gallery
ratify, the high-C/N probe-duration refit, the night-shift 10-bin
quantization fence, and the independent LIF raster (seed {aux['lif_seed']},
not a language-train remap) are absent from prior committed ouroboros
rounds in this window. Repeated elements discounted: same-gate contrast,
governance-pricing scaffold, flip-fragility series (extended to bed-true
certificate, but the move rhymes), sequenced recovery shape, third-factor
rollback form, negative-result primary. Adjacent thermal-bed rounds
(r64 malt kiln, r65 tobacco barn) share industrial-process scaffolding but
not Phase-II compost floor-spigot physics. Weighing a new failure
family + cure vocabulary + unused sub-domain + Mirelatch geography
against those reused scaffolds:

{NOVEL_LINE}

## What ROUND 06 should add
1. FIT THE DESIGNED CONSTANTS: spigot-collapse arrival, probe O2 bands,
   kill-to-cull mapping, night-shift claim process.
2. HIL PROVENANCE CELL: put the tunnel-gallery LOTO on a hardware-in-loop
   floor pendant with fitted latency as state.sim_or_real=hil — only if
   the plant is no longer purely invented.
3. CROSS-RECORD ARC: let CR-C-0506's local-TC alarm be the igniter of
   the next round rather than a dangling +21 d leaf.
4. Domain candidates (de-collided): constructed-wetland-polishing;
   hrsg-attemperator leftover variants if distinct from r23.
   AVOID mushroom-compost-tunnel (now used), malting-kiln-barn (r64),
   flue-cured-tobacco-barn (r65), farm-ad-biogas (r67),
   fen-polder-drainage-pumping (r04), alkaline-stack-hydrogen-quay (r03),
   and any LYOSHIELD / CINDERWICK / TRIAD / SKULLGATE / BOGIRON / SKARVOLT /
   PUSHERFELL / CREELWOLD / GIBBSQUERN / COILSHAW / LOOPERQUAY /
   SIPHONWOLD / WINDBOXHOLT / WOLD-BARN / LOCKSPUR / SLUICE-HEARTH /
   QUAY-FEN / LOCK-FEN / FEN-SPIT / BARN-SPIT / SPUR-HEARTH / SPIT-LOCK /
   BARN-FEN plant.
"""
    return notes
